WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.975
Tunnel Traitors is a mining game with a secret. Three to ten players, and not everybody wants the gold found.

2
00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:17.638
At the start of each round, you're secretly dealt a role, either a gold digger or a saboteur. You can peek at it any time by tapping the banner.

3
00:00:18.338 --> 00:00:29.039
On your turn you play one card. It might be a tunnel piece you connect to the path. It might be an action, like breaking someone's pickaxe, lamp, or cart, or repairing it.

4
00:00:29.189 --> 00:00:34.036
There's rockfall to remove a tunnel, and a map that lets you peek at the goal cards.

5
00:00:34.736 --> 00:00:40.562
Diggers win if the tunnel reaches the gold. Saboteurs win if the cards run out first.

6
00:00:40.712 --> 00:00:46.070
The tricky part is that saboteurs don't know each other, and diggers can't fully trust anyone.

7
00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:52.267
Was that dead end an innocent mistake? Or was it on purpose? You'll be wondering all game.
